==Strategy==
At the beginning of the stage, just send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]]. While they are doing their job, upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] to max level. Sadly, your meatshields won't be able to kill Jackie Peng and Gory, so start spawning [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]] when they appear. You will get quite a lot of money from them, so send out all your units at once and the incoming Sir Seal won't stand a chance.

When Le'boin spawns, you will want to spawn meatshields, Sexy Legs Cats and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cats]]. If your Titan Cat is at level 10, Le'boin will be a piece of cake. If not, don't worry, as you will kill him eventually.

Once Le'boin is defeated, Kang Roo will be very easy to kill. After that, just progress toward the enemy base, and do what you have to. Squire Rel will try to stop you, but her efforts will be in vain.

An alternative strategy is to continuously spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]], [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja Cats]], Wall Cats and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]]. Jackie Peng and Gory can easily be defeated by Frog Ninja Cat and Giraffe Cat and the meatshields will deal with Kang Roo. The best part about this strategy is that most of the time, you won't even have to deal with with Le'boin.

